Subject: [PATCH 8/8] fix(desktop): unscale selection anchor by CSS zoom and
 floor overlay right edge

Also adds parameterized zoom tests (0.9..1.5) for PersistentTerminal and zoom anchor test for terminalSelectionAnchor. Note: committed with --no-verify (authorized by Maintainer on local branch theme/one-dark-sync; lefthook uv hook fails in read-only sandbox).
